cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
type: software
title: "U.S. Macroeconomic Dynamics & GDP Growth Forecasting in MATLAB"
authors:
  - family-names: "Ghosh"
    given-names: "Sayak Pranab"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible MATLAB project for studying U.S. macroeconomic dynamics
  and GDP growth forecasting with FRED data, classical regression,
  distributed lags, structural-break analysis, out-of-sample evaluation,
  and expanding-window backtesting.
repository-code: "https://github.com/sayakdoms/matlab-macroeconomic-forecasting"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - MATLAB
  - macroeconometrics
  - forecasting
  - FRED
  - time series
  - expanding-window backtesting
  - structural break
  - reproducible research
